WEBVTT

00:01:32.940 --> 00:01:35.450
You still don't know where La Folia and her friends were taken?

00:01:35.910 --> 00:01:37.440
My apologies, Your Majesty!

00:01:37.440 --> 00:01:41.700
But during last night's attack,
the security cameras were disabled!

00:01:41.700 --> 00:01:43.910
Akatsuki Kojou, you idiot!

00:01:46.680 --> 00:01:48.220
If anything happens to Yukina...

00:01:48.220 --> 00:01:49.950
I'll make you pay!

00:01:51.820 --> 00:01:54.590
Excuse me, what are you all talking about?

00:01:55.690 --> 00:01:57.130
Aiba-san!

00:01:57.130 --> 00:01:59.840
Kojou and the girls were kidnapped?!

00:02:00.410 --> 00:02:04.350
The Inspector received a letter that we believe was sent by the culprits!

00:02:05.170 --> 00:02:09.060
In exchange for the princess,
they're demanding the release

00:02:09.060 --> 00:02:12.000
of 11 political prisoners
held in Aldegyrian prisons!

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:16.240
Damn it! These are all
convicts serving life sentences!

00:02:17.800 --> 00:02:20.070
Are you going to comply with their demands?

00:02:21.580 --> 00:02:24.040
La Folia-chan will be just fine.

00:02:25.690 --> 00:02:28.940
She already knows exactly what we must do,

00:02:28.940 --> 00:02:33.630
and what she herself must do in these situations.

00:02:36.050 --> 00:02:39.880
You're right. Aldegyr
doesn't negotiate with terrorists!

00:02:40.510 --> 00:02:43.200
We've always held steadfast to that principle,

00:02:43.200 --> 00:02:45.120
and we're not stopping now!

00:02:45.120 --> 00:02:47.130
But think about Kojou and the girls!

00:02:47.130 --> 00:02:48.060
Don't worry.

00:02:48.730 --> 00:02:52.060
The Magic Kingdom of Aldegyr will do all in its power

00:02:52.810 --> 00:02:56.030
to bring back La Folia and her friends.

00:02:57.690 --> 00:02:59.030
As we planned,

00:02:59.030 --> 00:03:03.030
we've sent them our declaration and
demand for the release of the political prisoners.

00:03:03.030 --> 00:03:07.040
Well, since it's Aldegyr we're dealing with,
they probably won't comply.

00:03:07.480 --> 00:03:11.120
Probably. But it'll throw them off
and buy us some time all the same.

00:03:12.460 --> 00:03:16.000
You and your men are as paranoid as ever.

00:03:17.030 --> 00:03:20.760
Has living in that frigid climate all your life
frozen your brain solid too?

00:03:21.360 --> 00:03:23.260
I'm just covering my bases.

00:03:23.860 --> 00:03:26.220
Listen, Trine Harden.

00:03:26.650 --> 00:03:30.300
We expect you to keep your end of the bargain.

00:03:33.190 --> 00:03:35.230
You don't need to worry about that.

00:03:35.230 --> 00:03:38.440
I even picked up an
unexpected helper along the way.

00:03:38.440 --> 00:03:41.020
I swear on the pride of the Free Terrorists,

00:03:41.020 --> 00:03:43.410
I'll follow through with your request.

00:03:44.700 --> 00:03:46.350
He's a dead man.

00:03:51.640 --> 00:03:56.920
Look, as Progenitors, what we seek
is the extension of the peace treaty.

00:03:57.300 --> 00:04:00.260
Don't ruin this for us over something small.

00:04:02.830 --> 00:04:06.960
Fine, but what if <i>they</i> try to interfere?

00:04:06.960 --> 00:04:09.220
In that case, we'll have no choice.

00:04:10.040 --> 00:04:12.850
Raze everything to the ground,
with extreme prejudice.

00:04:13.980 --> 00:04:16.310
I've finished this foot.

00:04:16.820 --> 00:04:19.080
This looks great, Kojou!

00:04:19.080 --> 00:04:21.040
All right, now for my other foot.

00:04:21.040 --> 00:04:22.200
My pleasure, ma'am.

00:04:25.600 --> 00:04:27.770
You're being noisy, girl.

00:04:27.770 --> 00:04:32.290
You're just an extra that came with La Folia, so zip it or I'll kill you.

00:04:35.450 --> 00:04:39.880
Oh, I see. You're jealous.

00:04:39.880 --> 00:04:41.260
You're in love with Kojou!

00:04:42.330 --> 00:04:45.760
The peanut gallery won't stop,
so let's move this to the bedroom!

00:04:45.760 --> 00:04:46.470
Yes, ma'am.

00:04:46.470 --> 00:04:51.080
I can't walk until my nails dry.
Carry me, Kojou.

00:04:51.080 --> 00:04:53.430
I'd love to, Mistress.

00:05:09.990 --> 00:05:12.960
The signing ceremony for Aldegyr and the Lost Warlord's Dominion

00:05:12.960 --> 00:05:17.920
is scheduled to be held this afternoon on
Itogami Island's newly-constructed Megafloat.

00:05:17.920 --> 00:05:21.880
In the 20th century, these two states
would often find themselves in conflict.

00:05:22.360 --> 00:05:24.550
However, since the peace accord was enacted,

00:05:24.550 --> 00:05:27.040
the military and economic power they had pointed at each other

00:05:27.040 --> 00:05:29.110
has been focused elsewhere.

00:05:29.110 --> 00:05:31.810
The two countries' progress is a sight to behold—

00:05:32.170 --> 00:05:34.770
The Aldegyrian royal family is known
for its many beautiful women.

00:05:35.390 --> 00:05:38.230
The queen and the princess are known as leaders in fashion around the world.

00:05:38.230 --> 00:05:42.190
What fashionable surprises they have in store for us today? I can't wait!

00:05:42.190 --> 00:05:47.660
The representative from the Dominion is Imperial Council Chairman Aladar, accompanied by—

00:05:48.020 --> 00:05:51.780
Kojou's a handful. Looks like he's landed himself in trouble again.

00:05:51.780 --> 00:05:56.620
Yeah. I'm going to go back to the
office and investigate what I can.

00:05:57.020 --> 00:05:59.340
If you find anything, let me know.

00:06:00.680 --> 00:06:05.090
Well, then. I just know something is
going to go down during the ceremony.

00:06:16.330 --> 00:06:20.640
Hey, you there! This area
is off limits! Show us your ID!

00:06:20.640 --> 00:06:23.150
I don't need to identify myself to you!

00:06:36.780 --> 00:06:39.200
It's light. Too light.

00:06:39.930 --> 00:06:43.650
Learn what real weight is,
from a fist cursed by the gods!

00:06:47.860 --> 00:06:48.470
How dare you!

00:06:49.680 --> 00:06:53.180
Who's next in line for a knuckle sandwich?

00:06:54.650 --> 00:06:57.180
What have you done to him?!

00:06:57.180 --> 00:06:58.800
You turned him just like that!

00:06:58.800 --> 00:07:03.160
Hypnosis and mind control spells aren't supposed to work on him!

00:07:03.160 --> 00:07:05.310
I don't disclose my trade secrets.

00:07:05.310 --> 00:07:07.570
Look, I'm only going to say this once.

00:07:07.920 --> 00:07:14.490
I could order Kojou to kill you
and your friend, or even himself.

00:07:15.400 --> 00:07:18.950
In other words, you're <i>all</i> hostages right now.

00:07:18.950 --> 00:07:23.340
If either of you act up, <i>someone</i> will have to pay the price with their life.

00:07:24.880 --> 00:07:26.420
Okay, it's time to move.

00:07:27.270 --> 00:07:28.420
Good idea, Mogwai.

00:07:28.420 --> 00:07:32.890
Search for Kojou, but focus on locations tied to the Kingdom of Aldegyr.

00:07:32.890 --> 00:07:35.420
Well now, that's a tall order... or not.

00:07:35.420 --> 00:07:38.850
I've detected an anomaly that fits perfectly.

00:07:38.850 --> 00:07:40.170
Where?

00:07:40.170 --> 00:07:41.380
The airport.

00:07:41.380 --> 00:07:45.540
It's that new armored airship,
the Bifröst. It sent out an order.

00:07:48.440 --> 00:07:51.530
Hijacking complete. Good work, Kojou.

00:07:51.530 --> 00:07:54.530
Is this why you kidnapped me?

00:07:56.180 --> 00:08:01.460
The royal family's airships need confirmation that one family member is aboard to activate.

00:08:01.460 --> 00:08:06.710
If you know that already, then I'd appreciate it
if you could hurry and activate the ship.

00:08:08.200 --> 00:08:09.670
What do you plan to achieve?

00:08:11.020 --> 00:08:13.630
We're going to fly to the
signing ceremony with this ship,

00:08:14.390 --> 00:08:16.600
and kill Lord Ardeal.

00:08:17.540 --> 00:08:20.600
Oh, my! Why didn't you tell me sooner?

00:08:21.040 --> 00:08:24.480
I would have aided you, and there would be no need for this kidnapping!

00:08:25.360 --> 00:08:26.460
La Folia-san!

00:08:26.460 --> 00:08:31.400
I've wanted to put the Lord Ardeal
out of his misery for so long!

00:08:31.400 --> 00:08:32.810
Do you know what you're saying?

00:08:32.810 --> 00:08:37.640
Do you know what will happen if an Aldegyrian ship
kills a noble from the Lost Warlord's Dominion—

00:08:37.640 --> 00:08:42.160
Our peace will fall apart,
and war will break out.

00:08:43.000 --> 00:08:47.790
But that's exactly what you and
the North Sea Empire seek, right?

00:08:49.040 --> 00:08:51.040
I knew it.

00:08:51.040 --> 00:08:52.260
Go right ahead.

00:08:53.010 --> 00:08:56.130
If you can take advantage of the
chaos to wipe out Lord Ardeal,

00:08:56.130 --> 00:08:58.050
then it's an unexpected windfall in our sails.

00:08:58.800 --> 00:09:03.060
Although, technically <i>I'm</i> starting the ship.

00:09:03.680 --> 00:09:05.840
Ship activation, confirmed!

00:09:05.840 --> 00:09:08.060
This settles my business with you two.

00:09:08.420 --> 00:09:11.740
Kojou, throw them into the cabin.

00:09:11.740 --> 00:09:13.290
Understood.

00:09:13.290 --> 00:09:14.280
Come.

00:09:14.280 --> 00:09:17.030
Why do you keep doing what she says?

00:09:18.990 --> 00:09:22.870
We're headed for war at this rate!

00:09:25.140 --> 00:09:27.850
Stop running your mouth, girl.

00:09:27.850 --> 00:09:31.050
Didn't I tell you? Kojou belongs to me now.

00:09:31.050 --> 00:09:31.860
Right?

00:09:31.860 --> 00:09:33.820
Yes, ma'am.

00:09:35.570 --> 00:09:38.260
Senpai, you idiot.

00:09:44.620 --> 00:09:45.680
Crap, I was too late!

00:09:46.620 --> 00:09:49.800
We have a situation here!
The Bifröst is airborne!

00:09:49.800 --> 00:09:52.650
Warn the Island Guard and the
security at the ceremony venue!

00:09:55.030 --> 00:09:58.570
I'm sorry to foist this on
you so suddenly, Kanon-chan.

00:09:58.930 --> 00:10:02.490
Not at all. I'm just glad that I can help.

00:10:02.870 --> 00:10:06.140
All right, let's be along now, <i>La Folia-chan</i>.

00:10:06.140 --> 00:10:08.040
Yes, <i>Mother</i>.

00:10:16.840 --> 00:10:19.030
Why did you launch the ship?

00:10:19.030 --> 00:10:22.390
Don't tell me you actually want war!

00:10:22.390 --> 00:10:27.850
Of course I was kidding,
as far as killing the Lord Ardeal goes.

00:10:28.980 --> 00:10:31.400
But what about the war?

00:10:31.400 --> 00:10:32.640
I'll stop it in its tracks.

00:10:33.490 --> 00:10:34.570
How?

00:10:35.640 --> 00:10:38.030
Yukina, aren't you feeling chilly?

00:10:38.030 --> 00:10:39.740
Pardon?

00:10:46.830 --> 00:10:47.660
There it is!

00:10:49.540 --> 00:10:51.500
Prepare to engage aircraft!

00:10:51.920 --> 00:10:53.450
It's the Island Guard.

00:10:53.450 --> 00:10:56.300
Have you finished programming them yet?

00:10:56.300 --> 00:10:56.760
Yes, sir!

00:10:57.910 --> 00:10:59.720
Good. Drop them!

00:11:05.030 --> 00:11:05.600
Here they come!

00:11:09.180 --> 00:11:10.390
Bergelmir!

00:11:10.890 --> 00:11:13.230
Aldegyr's magic-powered military drones!

00:11:13.230 --> 00:11:14.700
Fire the missiles!

00:11:14.700 --> 00:11:15.690
The targeting system—

00:11:15.690 --> 00:11:16.750
There's no time!

00:11:20.240 --> 00:11:24.130
The Island Guard are really being forced to maintain their position and defend,

00:11:24.130 --> 00:11:25.490
but then the venue's in danger!

00:11:28.120 --> 00:11:31.620
I, War Dancer of the High God and dancer of the Lion, beseech thee.

00:11:32.160 --> 00:11:35.460
Enku of the Aurora, Qilin of radiant light,

00:11:36.840 --> 00:11:39.310
thou who doth rule thunder and the heavens,

00:11:39.310 --> 00:11:40.800
come clad in raging fire

00:11:42.050 --> 00:11:44.900
to pierce Hell's monstrous demons!

00:11:58.210 --> 00:12:01.490
There are too many. I'll never get them all!

00:12:01.980 --> 00:12:04.620
Execute, Rhododactylos.

00:12:21.350 --> 00:12:22.930
What the heck are those?!

00:12:22.930 --> 00:12:27.060
Magic-powered military drones,
and state-of-the-art ones at that too.

00:12:27.060 --> 00:12:28.640
They won't be easy to deal with.

00:12:28.640 --> 00:12:31.970
But the bigger problem is Bifröst.

00:12:31.970 --> 00:12:35.600
It set sail and is now drifting towards the venue.

00:12:35.600 --> 00:12:38.700
For crying out loud, why is this happening?

00:12:38.700 --> 00:12:39.780
What are you doing?

00:12:39.780 --> 00:12:41.860
I'm hacking into Bifröst's systems!

00:12:41.860 --> 00:12:43.260
Oh?

00:12:43.260 --> 00:12:45.090
It's got a military-grade firewall, you know.

00:12:45.090 --> 00:12:45.920
Can you do it?

00:12:45.920 --> 00:12:48.120
It's not a question of whether I can! I have to!

00:12:48.950 --> 00:12:52.120
And now for a speech from the representative
of the Lost Warlord's Dominion,

00:12:52.120 --> 00:12:56.090
Imperial Council Chairman Veres Aladar.

00:13:02.230 --> 00:13:04.170
Get ready to drop Aurgelmir!

00:13:04.170 --> 00:13:07.210
We have less than three minutes
till they make contact.

00:13:07.210 --> 00:13:08.640
Gosh, this is a pain!

00:13:08.640 --> 00:13:11.850
I don't care how small, but I just need a lead!

00:13:11.850 --> 00:13:14.050
Then, how about this?

00:13:14.940 --> 00:13:17.310
Is that one of the
magic-powered drones they sent out?

00:13:17.310 --> 00:13:18.770
Bingo!

00:13:19.730 --> 00:13:23.490
If you had that kind of intel, you should've said so, you useless piece of shellcode!

00:13:24.480 --> 00:13:25.700
Explosion onboard!

00:13:26.160 --> 00:13:29.910
Those girls did it?
They're trying to play hero, I guess.

00:13:32.990 --> 00:13:35.210
You had explosives incorporated
into your hair extensions?!

00:13:36.070 --> 00:13:39.670
But why did you have to
make the room so hot?

00:13:40.040 --> 00:13:41.780
I'm covered in sweat now, thanks to that!

00:13:41.780 --> 00:13:44.520
Is that right? That's a shame.

00:13:44.520 --> 00:13:45.630
That's all you have to say?

00:13:46.080 --> 00:13:49.740
And speaking of sweat, you're completely dry!

00:13:49.740 --> 00:13:53.150
I used cooling magic to keep myself comfortable!

00:13:53.150 --> 00:13:54.100
What?!

00:13:54.570 --> 00:13:56.230
That's as far as you go, girls.

00:13:56.810 --> 00:14:01.190
If you had stayed put, I would've found another use for you later.

00:14:01.190 --> 00:14:03.040
Too bad.

00:14:03.040 --> 00:14:04.230
Get them, Kojou.

00:14:04.770 --> 00:14:06.150
Yes, ma'am.

00:14:06.150 --> 00:14:07.110
Senpai!

00:14:11.490 --> 00:14:12.700
What was that?!

00:14:13.110 --> 00:14:14.040
Hey!

00:14:14.040 --> 00:14:14.660
What is this?

00:14:15.190 --> 00:14:17.000
We've been infiltrated from the outside!

00:14:17.000 --> 00:14:18.920
Score! I'm in the ship's control system!

00:14:18.920 --> 00:14:21.340
I'm not letting you go any further!

00:14:22.720 --> 00:14:24.050
Turn the ship!

00:14:24.050 --> 00:14:27.100
Aurgelmir's hatch won't open!

00:14:27.800 --> 00:14:29.510
The armaments should still be working.

00:14:29.900 --> 00:14:30.970
In that case...

00:14:35.430 --> 00:14:36.060
Fire!

00:14:42.920 --> 00:14:44.500
A cruise missile!

00:15:12.800 --> 00:15:14.890
My, what a beautiful gun salute!

00:15:15.650 --> 00:15:18.060
Let us never stop hoping that both countries

00:15:18.060 --> 00:15:20.220
are ever more peaceful and prosperous.

00:15:26.690 --> 00:15:27.760
It self-detonated?

00:15:27.760 --> 00:15:29.780
The weapons control system did it...

00:15:34.710 --> 00:15:35.990
I made it!

00:15:37.590 --> 00:15:38.950
What a shame.

00:15:38.950 --> 00:15:40.840
What are you doing?!

00:15:40.840 --> 00:15:43.880
We've lost control of the Bifröst!

00:15:43.880 --> 00:15:44.920
In that case...

00:15:45.400 --> 00:15:46.170
Kojou!

00:15:46.170 --> 00:15:47.830
Yes, ma'am?

00:15:47.830 --> 00:15:51.900
Finishing it off with Aldegyr's drones was
our ideal option, but things have changed.

00:15:51.900 --> 00:15:54.850
Demolish the ceremony venue with your familiars!

00:15:56.130 --> 00:15:58.220
Yes, my lady!

00:16:01.060 --> 00:16:02.230
I won't let you!

00:16:05.160 --> 00:16:05.900
Senpai!

00:16:15.580 --> 00:16:16.370
Senpai?

00:16:21.450 --> 00:16:25.080
I'll never get over how good you smell, Himeragi.

00:16:27.150 --> 00:16:28.690
Senpai!

00:16:28.690 --> 00:16:30.340
Kojou? How?

00:16:30.340 --> 00:16:32.070
Deal with it!

00:16:32.070 --> 00:16:34.590
Kojou won't be taking orders from you any longer!

00:16:35.720 --> 00:16:40.450
You're a Beastman, and one of civet lineage, I bet.

00:16:40.450 --> 00:16:41.980
I've heard of this before.

00:16:42.570 --> 00:16:49.810
Among such Beastmen, some can use pheromones
to take control of someone, even a vampire.

00:16:49.810 --> 00:16:55.400
That's right. But no one's ever been able to
escape from the clutch of my pheromones.

00:16:55.400 --> 00:16:56.830
How did he?

00:16:56.830 --> 00:16:58.580
Oh, it's quite simple.

00:16:59.070 --> 00:17:03.820
I made sure Yukina was covered from
head to toe in sweat before she got here.

00:17:04.410 --> 00:17:08.300
Between the aroma of young
teenage girl drenched in sweat

00:17:08.300 --> 00:17:10.880
and an overperfumed wench...

00:17:11.740 --> 00:17:15.260
You don't even need to ask
which one will win over a man!

00:17:15.260 --> 00:17:16.900
Who are you calling a wench?!

00:17:16.900 --> 00:17:20.970
Oh, pardon me! Bimbo, not wench.

00:17:20.970 --> 00:17:23.730
Why, you bitch!

00:17:26.830 --> 00:17:27.650
Oh, no!

00:17:29.510 --> 00:17:33.110
It appears that my men below us
are prepared to take this to the end!

00:17:33.110 --> 00:17:37.400
Whatever! Just blow the hatch open, Aurgelmir!

00:17:42.370 --> 00:17:43.330
Look out!

00:17:46.910 --> 00:17:53.580
We'll crush everything, whether it be you,
this ship, or the ceremony venue!

00:17:56.130 --> 00:17:57.430
Senpai!

00:17:57.430 --> 00:17:58.640
Himeragi.

00:18:17.200 --> 00:18:22.910
Now, then. Let's see how much longer you can keep your cool!

00:18:27.830 --> 00:18:28.460
Pulsation!

00:18:30.710 --> 00:18:32.250
Damn you, little girl!

00:18:33.070 --> 00:18:34.500
Sword Shaman!

00:18:34.500 --> 00:18:36.510
You have a package from the War Dancer.

00:18:37.860 --> 00:18:40.470
She has some nerve to use me
as a delivery service.

00:18:41.020 --> 00:18:43.840
I'll capture the terrorists!

00:18:43.840 --> 00:18:46.480
Can I leave this area to you, Akatsuki Kojou?

00:18:46.920 --> 00:18:47.870
Yeah.

00:18:48.650 --> 00:18:53.900
Hey, Miss Terrorist. You turning me
into a toy and playing with me,

00:18:54.340 --> 00:18:57.530
means that from here on out,
this is <i>my</i> fight.

00:18:58.980 --> 00:19:01.490
No, Senpai, this is <i>our</i> fight!

00:19:01.490 --> 00:19:02.950
Go to hell!

00:19:04.750 --> 00:19:07.720
Ye who lay claim to the line of Kaleid Blood,

00:19:07.720 --> 00:19:11.540
I, Akatsuki Kojou, release your shackles.

00:19:12.360 --> 00:19:16.550
Come, Fifth Familiar Regulus Aurum!

00:19:21.840 --> 00:19:25.560
I, Sword Shaman of the High God and priestess of the Lion, beseech thee.

00:19:26.630 --> 00:19:28.770
Morning light of exorcism,
spirit wolf of snowy mist,

00:19:29.410 --> 00:19:30.730
bestow me the iron might of Heaven,

00:19:31.170 --> 00:19:33.360
so I may smite a hundred evil spirits!

00:19:55.460 --> 00:19:57.190
We did it, Senpai!

00:19:57.190 --> 00:19:57.840
Yeah!

00:19:58.260 --> 00:20:02.050
But we might have gone a little overboard.

00:20:02.050 --> 00:20:02.910
Huh?

00:20:09.470 --> 00:20:13.980
Gimme a break!

00:21:46.580 --> 00:21:50.370
Thank you, Kojou. I had a great trip.

00:21:50.370 --> 00:21:53.240
Oh, really. That's good to hear.

00:21:54.330 --> 00:21:58.570
Kanon-chan, I want you to
come visit us in Aldegyr, okay?

00:21:58.570 --> 00:21:59.360
Yes!

00:21:59.360 --> 00:22:00.840
Isn't that great, Kanon-chan?

00:22:01.420 --> 00:22:06.670
It kind of sucks that everything
was over before I woke up.

00:22:07.690 --> 00:22:13.010
Kojou-san, I want you to really think about marrying into our family.

00:22:13.010 --> 00:22:17.490
If you do, we'll write off the loss of the Bifröst.

00:22:18.460 --> 00:22:19.910
Listen, you vile wretch!

00:22:20.400 --> 00:22:24.310
Don't get a big head
just 'cause you beat Aurgelmir!

00:22:24.310 --> 00:22:28.650
That was our kingdom's <i>weakest</i> magic weapon!

00:22:28.650 --> 00:22:32.080
We also have Loki, Thor,
and our strongest weapon, Odin—

00:22:32.080 --> 00:22:35.160
Yes, yes. We're leaving, Dear.

00:22:32.690 --> 00:22:35.160
Our strongest weapon, Odin—

00:22:35.160 --> 00:22:35.800
Yes, ma'am!

00:22:40.520 --> 00:22:44.050
Welp, they're finally gone.

00:22:47.050 --> 00:22:48.260
What's wrong, Himeragi?

00:22:48.260 --> 00:22:54.260
S-Senpai, you don't remember what went on while you were under Trine's control, right?

00:22:55.740 --> 00:22:57.200
I told you already.

00:22:57.200 --> 00:23:04.360
It's like, uh, I remember beating Aurgelmir, but I don't have any memories before that.

00:23:05.050 --> 00:23:07.900
Then, that's good. For both of us.

00:23:07.900 --> 00:23:12.690
Both of us? Myself aside, <i>you</i> don't have anything to worry about!

00:23:13.280 --> 00:23:15.580
You <i>do</i> remember!

00:23:15.960 --> 00:23:17.820
Oh, come on! What do you want me to say?

00:23:17.820 --> 00:23:20.430
Look, compared to me, who was forced to act

00:23:20.430 --> 00:23:23.040
like I was in some stupid anime, you had it easy—

00:23:23.040 --> 00:23:25.460
H-Hey! Get off!

00:23:24.410 --> 00:23:26.820
Senpai, you're so repulsive!

00:23:26.820 --> 00:23:28.800
How dare you be her boy toy!

00:23:28.800 --> 00:23:31.390
What did you two do in that bedroom?

00:23:31.390 --> 00:23:31.970
And...

00:23:32.920 --> 00:23:38.740
When you told me I smelled nice,
even though I was covered in sweat, I—

00:23:40.770 --> 00:23:43.230
Gosh, what are you making me say?!

00:23:43.670 --> 00:23:46.980
Senpai, you idiot!
